            {
              "content": "=Your task is to customize an email template using the following data:\n\nFirst Name: {{ $json['First Name'] }}\nLast Name: {{ $json['Last Name'] }}\nEmail: {{ $json.Email }}\nPhone Number: {{ $json.contato_formatado }}\nDesign Preference: {{ $json['Design Preference'] }}\nBrand Description: {{ $json['Brand Description'] }}\nTimeline: {{ $json.Timeline }}\n\n\n--\n\nEmail Template:\n\nHey {first Name},\n\nHow are you? Thanks for submitting your onboarding form a moment ago.\n\nI loved reading about how {paraphrase Brand Description}\n\nI see here you're looking for {Design Preference} sort of site and you looking have done in {Timeline}\n\n\nWould you confirming your number and email for me one last time {contato_formatado} and {Email}, right?\n\nThanks\nDocs.com\n\n--\n\nWrite it to end user like it`s me\nDon`t include the subject line"
            }
